s-set), and [Skinny Macho](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set) to bring in the new decade. \n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set)\n- [Sasha Marie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set)\n- [Budgie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set)\n- [Skinny Macho's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-01-01T14:41:45+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"2m1jBRPKRPU","position":17,"timestamp":"00:31:56","rawTrack":"Timbaland & Magoo - Timbo Cop That Shit (feat. Missy Elliott)","track":{"id":"9obbkvkNKV8","path":"/artists/timbaland-magoo/tracks/timbo-cop-that-shit-feat-missy-elliott/","slug":"timbo-cop-that-shit-feat-missy-elliott","title":"Timbo Cop That Shit (feat. Missy Elliott)","artist":{"slug":"timbaland-and-magoo","title":"Timbaland & Magoo"},"artwork":"images/artists/timbaland-magoo/tracks/timbo-cop-that-shit-feat-missy-elliott.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Qjt-p40LBfo","slug":"522","tags":[5,6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-522/ra.1585226526","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-522-k-le-maestro-takeover"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #522 (K, Le Maestro Takeover)","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-522.jpg","content":"London producer K, Le Maestro takes over the show.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-09-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"K, Le Maestro's Takeover","position":0}},{"id":"2eVbNBxwlEQ","position":30,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Timbaland & Magoo - Up Jumps Da Boogie (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"ct7ELGEwdb4","path":"/artists/timbaland-magoo/tracks/up-jumps-da-boogie-instrumental/","slug":"up-jumps-da-boogie-instrumental","title":"Up Jumps Da Boogie